{"title":"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df44bcb7d53451ffcf03417528ef7c6b3331d70a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i(i-1)(i-2)(i-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac5dec897250384833e3c1b44639bf91cca823a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i = \\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050967875ad13f23e64f9c9f1893825e19fe918e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~6-5i \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}~-10i \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}~10i \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}~-10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}~10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"482\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d1832af4bf09f62e52da5073d7846b576409f436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i(i-3)=-1-3i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2ab1c073aa29ec5fe6555d3057b1ad5ac5f26e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i-1)(i-2)=-1-3i+2=1-3i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"293\" height=\"20\" />, so\n</p><p>\\begin{align}\ni(i-1)(i-2)(i-3)&amp;=i(i-3)\\cdot (i-1)(i-2)\\\\\n&amp;=(-1-3i)(1-3i)\\\\\n&amp;=-(1+3i)(1-3i)\\\\\n&amp;=-(1^2-(3i)^2)\\\\\n&amp;=-(1+9)\\\\\n&amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~-10 }\n\\end{align}\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7AKIqbFWF-w\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7AKIqbFWF-w</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B\">2025 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> 